{"4642060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "InVein", "steam_appid": 4642060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hostile Hospital Awaits...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake in a vintage hospital room connected to a strange IV stand, unsure of who you are or why you’re here. All you know is if your IV disconnects, you won’t last long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push through the doors in the middle of the night, finding no one around at all as you wander the dark halls. Your IV begins to slow, and your vision begins to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you collapse, the room begins to warp and change, and you swear you can hear footsteps nearby...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       A short yet story driven single player horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Slow building urge to move through space while managing resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Stunning visual effects and environment as you move throughout the days</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       A focus on exploration with classic puzzles, as you slowly uncover the secrets of the hospital</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assets used in the game created by the team during development, no paid or generated assets.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hostile Hospital Awaits...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake in a vintage hospital room connected to a strange IV stand, unsure of who you are or why you’re here. All you know is if your IV disconnects, you won’t last long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push through the doors in the middle of the night, finding no one around at all as you wander the dark halls. Your IV begins to slow, and your vision begins to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you collapse, the room begins to warp and change, and you swear you can hear footsteps nearby...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       A short yet story driven single player horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Slow building urge to move through space while managing resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Stunning visual effects and environment as you move throughout the days</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       A focus on exploration with classic puzzles, as you slowly uncover the secrets of the hospital</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assets used in the game created by the team during development, no paid or generated assets.</p>", "short_description": "Traverse this never-ending hospital as you discover clues of where and who you are. As each day passes by, the world around you decays, and you can’t help but wonder what is real. Utilize your time and resources as you roam these collapsing halls, but be careful; you may not be alone after all...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4642060/c6d418004c3fddeabcef3d92fd9094d294658113/header.jpg?t=1778778178", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4642060/a3bcba7999a10fa373d36f9e644cc9c2f85dd840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778778178", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4642060/a3bcba7999a10fa373d36f9e644cc9c2f85dd840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778778178", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD 2.5 GHz or superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any DirectX 11 or 12 compatible card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>